# The root R0 without an entry. The positive choice of both same-named occurrences, by their index in S (the
# coordinates of Sol and Astra for the row construction_path_ambiguous), on ordinary Structures: `S\[0]f` and
# `S\[1]f`. `call(code := D\F1\go)` and `call(code := D\F2\go)` select the code by naming its formal; each body reads
# the value of the occurrence its parent's input names and writes it into `Log`: first 11, second 12; before 1, after 1.
@: Log (int: before 0; int: first 0; int: second 0; int: after 0)
@: D (
    S(f(int: v 11); f(int: v 12))
    F1(
        @: p S\[0]f
        go:
            Log\first := p\v
        end: go
    )
    F2(
        @: p S\[1]f
        go:
            Log\second := p\v
        end: go
    )
)
Log\before := 1
call(code := D\F1\go)
call(code := D\F2\go)
Log\after := 1
